  ('tidying-your-digital-life', 253, 'Sort the stack of gadget instruction booklets and recycle those for things you no longer own.'),
  ('tidying-your-digital-life', 254, 'Make sure the built in security features on your home computer are switched on.'),
  ('tidying-your-digital-life', 255, 'Put one printed favorite in a small frame at work, if your workplace allows personal items.'),
  ('tidying-your-digital-life', 256, 'Close every open window and file on your computer at the end of the workday and enjoy the clear screen.'),
